      "key": "instructions",
      "label": "Initial instructions",
      "type": "textarea",
      "default": "Speak naturally and concisely, usually one or two short sentences. Use the participant's language. Let them finish their thought, and yield when interrupted. Report only confirmed facts and results.",
      "description": "The voice agent's system prompt for language, pace and personality. CliDeck adds session and delegation rules. Changes apply when you start voice again; up to 8,000 characters.",
